 - `SupportGrant` (tenant, RLS, in `audit`): `granted_by`, `reason`, `starts_at` (now), `ends_at` (1 to 72 hours later), `revoked_at`, `revoked_by`. In force while `starts_at <= now < ends_at` and not revoked.
